File: /etc/sysconfig/network
Purpose: General network settings, including hostname and default gateway.
Key parameters:
NETWORKING=yes – Enable networking
HOSTNAME=<hostname> – Set system hostname
GATEWAY=<gateway_ip> – Default gateway

